cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FCT_RHI: Data-Driven C++20 Multi-Backend RHI and RenderGraph Library"
message: "If you use FCT_RHI in your projects, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MaaBlock"
    website: "https://github.com/MaaBlock"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaaBlock/FCT_RHI"
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform C++20 Render Hardware Interface (RHI) and RenderGraph library for Vulkan,
  DirectX 12, and WebGL2/WebAssembly, featuring data-driven rendering, a declarative data
  configuration workflow, and pluggable microkernel modules.
keywords:
  - rhi
  - render-hardware-interface
  - render-graph
  - data-driven
  - data-configuration-workflow
  - microkernel
  - plugin-architecture
  - vulkan
  - directx-12
  - webgl2
  - webassembly
  - cpp20
  - bindless
  - ray-tracing
  - 数据驱动
  - 数据配置流程
  - 微内核插件制
